# A RHEL9 desktop's libraries and nothing to build with, to run the RHEL9
# build in (app/distro/smoke.sh): AlmaLinux 9 with the X libraries puritty
# links, fontconfig and a monospace font, and Xvfb to draw on.
#
#   podman build -t puritty-run-rhel9 app/distro/rhel9/run
FROM docker.io/library/almalinux:9
RUN dnf -y install dnf-plugins-core \
 && dnf config-manager --set-enabled crb \
 && dnf -y install libxcb xcb-util xcb-util-image xcb-util-renderutil libxkbcommon-x11 \
      fontconfig dejavu-sans-mono-fonts libpng zlib xorg-x11-server-Xvfb xkeyboard-config procps-ng \
 && dnf clean all
